From 81ac7c7aa0f2deb85f3e6f5660fa95f39c21b42d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: wmehanna <wassimmehanna@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 18:43:11 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] feat(vmapple): bring up macOS 27 on the vmapple machine

Brings the machine up to the point where a macOS 27 installed system
boots to userspace under TCG.

- 1 MiB config blob, unknown MMIO window and the 0xC1 hypercall stub.
- MSI frame device and sorted PCI capability lists.
- AES engine model uses the QEMU AES block code.
- Handoff properties written for XNU: internal-use-only-unit, the SIP
  policy (lp-sip0) and the command line.
- 16 KiB target pages, as macOS maps nothing smaller.
- Do not offer the virtio-net control queue.
- Handoff and hypercall/MSI boot tests (tests/27on86 and the qtest).
